            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Go now to the Fairegrounds in Cyclops Lane to see what emissary appears to teach you this powerful Life spell. Remember to hold your flowers and recite the Rota of Reading, just as I instructed you.",
